{"brief": "为 Microduck 设计一个友好、有辨识度的头顶外观装饰件，具体视觉主题由你决定。保留原机器人和相机，不做尖锐或夸张笨重的造型。希望它作为个性化可打印原型展示；安装方式和真实运动性能仍待验证。请根据实际整机与近景渲染进行有限轮审查和修改。", "eligible": [{"round": 0, "review": {"recipe_sha256": "0ff240bb16972265f2f6e7916359508d501171483b3dc75d4c806372e187c528", "verdict": "meets-brief", "findings": ["Whole-robot and close-up renders (recipe digest duckling_tuft_crest, recipe_sha256 0ff240bb...) show a small soft backward-leaning tuft with bilateral bumps in duck-yellow, coherent with the source head's yellow accents; silhouette is rounded and friendly with no sharp or bulky features.", "CAD facts confirm solids=1: the revision fixed the round-00 floating/disconnected geometry; the tuft (lowest swept Z ≈1 mm) and mirrored bumps (lowest Z ≈0.5 mm) now positively overlap the 2.5 mm base, so no floating or disconnected lumps remain.", "Part mass 2.06 g, extent 17.7×17×13.0 mm, well inside the zone and far below its max Z; it does not obstruct the camera face in any rendered view, and motion checks pass at all 31 poses (min distance 17.2 mm, no violations).", "Rendered placement reads as slightly perched above the curved shell crown because the flat elliptical base meets a curved surface, but the fused single solid and the pad-attachment intent make this acceptable for a prototype study; curvature fit and adhesive retention remain explicitly open.", "No implausibly large or obstructive geometry identified; source shells, motors, joints and camera remain intact and visible in all four views."], "next_step": "stop", "reason": "The built candidate is host-eligible (proof accepted, single fused solid, motion passed) and the renders confirm a compact, friendly, recognizable duckling-tuft crest that preserves the robot identity and camera view. The revision resolved the prior disconnected-feature failure. Remaining uncertainties (curvature fit, adhesive retention, print behavior, real motion) are unverified-interface items outside this study's scope, so no further rounds are needed."}, "candidate": {"directory": "/home/exuber/CODE/CORE/pythonProject1/AUTORESEARCH/fluxkernel/.demo/v010-personalization/robot-pal-a03ce4b3/round-00/microduck-part-d2b80ad3", "native_sha256": "f5882c4a1635022ba4a9e0ec17aa014a0e769a95e6b6016484747f492a39e937", "name": "microduck", "bodies": 16, "joints": 15, "actuators": 14, "meshes": 39, "mass_kg": 0.7392984135627633, "proof_accepted": true, "deployment_ready": false, "accepted": true, "motion_passed": true, "motion_summary": {"minimum_distance_m": 0.01722026532524078, "violations": []}, "part_body": "custom_duckling_tuft_crest", "added_mass_kg": 0.0020552335627632176, "interface_status": "unverified", "recipe_sha256": "0ff240bb16972265f2f6e7916359508d501171483b3dc75d4c806372e187c528"}}]}
